eat to public safety the u.s marshals  are asking hill to turn himself  in or for members of the public to  report  if they see him vanessa murphy 8 news  now  so if you do have any information on  roland hills whereabouts you're urged to  call the u.s marshal's office  the number there on your screen  702-388-6355
 

